5. The Industry Case (Per DIN/BSMI Guidance)
Following the recommendation from engaged National Bodies, ST-T1024 is now being
positioned for industry-led adoption.
Beachhead Industries: Automotive (ISO 26262), Industrial Control (IEC 61508), Aerospace
(DO-178C), Medical (IEC 62304).
Value Proposition to Industry:
· Deterministic behavior enables functional safety certification (no probabilistic safety
margins)
· Ultra-low energy enables deployment at edge (no data center dependency)
· Air-gapped execution ensures data sovereignty (no foreign cloud routing)
· RISC-V architecture enables supply chain sovereignty (no vendor lock-in)
Current Status: Industry engagement is ongoing. Pilots are being structured with prospective
OEMs. This document is provided for National Body reference as industry interest develops.
